{"results":[{"id":"6a468e99941f9e2f4d672d80","name":"GitHub Impersonation Deploys Information Stealer","description":"An internal security operations team identified a fraudulent GitHub page impersonating a cybersecurity vendor to target customers and the general public. The malicious page appeared legitimate by referencing authentic services and operational requirements. While the GitHub page itself contained non-malicious content, a disguised link led victims to download a ZIP archive containing malicious executables. The attack chain deployed BoryptGrab Stealer information-stealing malware through DLL side-loading techniques. Investigation revealed nearly 300 similar repositories impersonating well-known organizations including Malwarebytes, Bitdefender, and 360 Total Security, using SEO keywords to attract victims. The malicious page has been removed and detection capabilities have been enhanced.","author_name":"AlienVault","modified":"2026-07-03T07:03:45.046000","created":"2026-07-02T16:15:21.729000","revision":2,"tlp":"white","public":1,"adversary":"","indicators":[{"id":4444658840,"indicator":"b98575f3c0259b480a31b917aa73bc56","type":"FileHash-MD5","created":"2026-07-02T16:15:22","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4444658841,"indicator":"fd01262bd56510088b9ddfe58ca101ab","type":"FileHash-MD5","created":"2026-07-02T16:15:22","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4445106825,"indicator":"https:\/\/bentleyvazquezpvey.github.io\/.github\/","type":"URL","created":"2026-07-03T07:03:17","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":""},{"id":4445106826,"indicator":"https:\/\/github.com\/Arctic-Wolf-Security","type":"URL","created":"2026-07-03T07:03:17","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":""},{"id":4445106827,"indicator":"https:\/\/github.com\/antivirus-free-bitdefender","type":"URL","created":"2026-07-03T07:03:17","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":""},{"id":4445106828,"indicator":"https:\/\/github.com\/malwarebytes-protection","type":"URL","created":"2026-07-03T07:03:17","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":""}],"tags":["information stealer","dll side-loading","social engineering","github impersonation","boryptgrab stealer","boryptgrab","seo poisoning","fake repositories"],"targeted_countries":[],"malware_families":["BoryptGrab Stealer"],"attack_ids":["T1056.001","T1539","T1036.005","T1204.002","T1566.002","T1566.001","T1082","T1140","T1555","T1036","T1083","T1566","T1027","T1518.001","T1189","T1518","T1574.002","T1105"],"references":["https:\/\/arcticwolf.com\/resources\/blog\/security-bulletin-github-impersonation-deploys-information-stealer\/"],"industries":[],"extract_source":[],"more_indicators":false},{"id":"6a46d120d41fcc87a8a52932","name":"Vibe Coded Extortion: Path from Legal Lure to CrownX Ransom Capabilities","description":"A sophisticated multi-stage phishing campaign delivers a previously undocumented framework called Avalon through spoofed legal documents hosted on Proton Drive. The intrusion begins with password-protected archives containing ISO images that execute malicious MSBuild projects, loading payloads entirely in memory without conventional executable attachments. Avalon consolidates credential theft, lateral movement, recovery disruption, and ransomware capabilities within a single framework, with its encryption component branded as CrownX. The framework demonstrates hallmarks of AI-assisted development, rapidly combining multiple post-exploitation capabilities that previously required sustained development effort. Avalon targets browsers, cryptocurrency wallets, messaging platforms, VPN configurations, and infrastructure systems while implementing extensive defense evasion techniques against major security products. The framework disrupts recovery by eliminating Volume Shadow Copies, Windows Recovery Environment...","author_name":"AlienVault","modified":"2026-07-03T07:00:13.819000","created":"2026-07-02T20:59:12.945000","revision":2,"tlp":"white","public":1,"adversary":"","indicators":[{"id":4444710862,"indicator":"c3587edc48c37656b29bcd3da9458eea","type":"FileHash-MD5","created":"2026-07-02T20:59:13","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4444710863,"indicator":"4b7301f02b8312ae6de614981f325dbbabee32166630618fdff74615d9a487ba","type":"FileHash-SHA256","created":"2026-07-02T20:59:13","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4444710864,"indicator":"59a260716d05c20229c6a46fe0a2fb5b80fa30c9c73a850222d9d3454426a60a","type":"FileHash-SHA256","created":"2026-07-02T20:59:13","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4444710865,"indicator":"607cb58b8a592885eef5cfbe35ddce962741b0775c575f58cb3a96ca0ee893a6","type":"FileHash-SHA256","created":"2026-07-02T20:59:13","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4444710866,"indicator":"adbc18f15019ef2ba6890b7996445c14350d57ba772eb33182889bc14ac47085","type":"FileHash-SHA256","created":"2026-07-02T20:59:13","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4444710867,"indicator":"b7d50d0406afcd2efd87bf3bf8c4211719ba9817dd2e0ad62af10c933e765e28","type":"FileHash-SHA256","created":"2026-07-02T20:59:13","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4444710868,"indicator":"c725815cbb07ab5be8903e74ef8aea46ef9c25e4a3bc626ae94bfc1ae21df6e3","type":"FileHash-SHA256","created":"2026-07-02T20:59:13","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4444710869,"indicator":"e3ec5926a167d6e3359f98cdfb7ac3b2cce97652843056505d02e6d2898573c6","type